<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/18/eng@/~cl_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Subsection 28(1) of the principal Act is amended by inserting after the words “the purpose of” the words “inspecting,”."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/18/eng@> .
